        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Shim Ji-ho, Suh Jung, Park Chul-soo\n- Products: School 2, My Lovely Family, Our Stance on How to Treat a Break-up, Color of Women, Green Chair, The Isle, Yellow Flower, Spider Forest, Desert Dream\n- Events: 2005 Sundance Film Festival\n- Topics: television dramas, film casting, film plot\n\nFacts:\n- Shim Ji-ho starred in the television drama \"School 2\" in 1999.\n- Suh Jung was cast in the lead in the film \"The Isle\" in 2000.\n- Suh Jung was cast in the lead in the film \"Yellow Flower\" in 2002.\n- Shim Ji-ho starred in the television drama \"My Lovely Family\" in 2004.\n- Suh Jung was cast in the lead in the film \"Spider Forest\" in 2004.\n- Shim Ji-ho starred in the television drama \"Our Stance on How to Treat a Break-up\" in 2005.\n- Park Chul-soo directed the erotic film \"Green Chair,\" which premiered at the 2005 Sundance Film Festival.\n- \"Green Chair\" is about an affair between an attractive thirty-two-year-old woman and a youth just short of legal majority.\n- Suh Jung was cast in the lead in the film \"Green Chair\" in 2005.\n- Suh Jung was cast in the lead in the film \"Desert Dream\" in 2007.\n- Shim Ji-ho starred in the television drama \"Color of Women\" in 2011.",
